            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[- Added reason-coded usage statistics to help diagnose why a paired iPhone asks you to answer on your Mac. These use one event, `companion_answer_on_mac`, and follow your anonymous usage stats setting.
- Question text stays in a local log on your Mac; it is not included in these usage events.

The iPhone companion remains in private TestFlight testing and is not yet publicly available.
]]></description>
